From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP contiguous-bar ticket clamp + gap hold

Neighbor sim-distance cannot refill a registered cut. Unload the corridor
holder, return air instead of sync-load, and keep the carve plan so gap
hold registers after forcePartition. Lab: smoke-contiguous-bar PASS.
Post-applyAllPatches.
